# ── Runtime data (generated at runtime, not part of source) ──────────────────
# AllyCode stores runtime data under ~/.allycode/ or $ALLYCODE_DATA_DIR.
# If ALLYCODE_DATA_DIR is pointed inside the repo, these patterns protect it.
/MEMORY/
*.allycode/
debug.log
*.log
.release/

